  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Together for Life Core Support</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Together for Life Core Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing core support to the objectives of the Strategic Plan 2022-  2025 of the Together for Life organization in Albania. The organization overall objective is to work towards achieving an equitable society, which does not discriminate against the poor, the weak, women or minorities; increase people&#x2019;s rights and
promote development, by working at the grassroots level with individual people and communities.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tillhandah&#xe5;lla k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till m&#xe5;len i Strategiplanen 2022-2025 organisationen Together for Life i Albanien. Organisationens &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att arbeta f&#xf6;r att uppn&#xe5; ett r&#xe4;ttvist samh&#xe4;lle, som inte diskriminerar fattiga, svaga, kvinnor eller minoriteter; &#xf6;ka m&#xe4;nniskors r&#xe4;ttigheter och
fr&#xe4;mja utveckling genom att arbeta p&#xe5; gr&#xe4;srotsniv&#xe5; med enskilda m&#xe4;nniskor och samh&#xe4;llen.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution will provide core Support to &quot;Together for Life (TFL)&quot; organization as per the Strategic Plan of the Organization 2022-2025. 

The main strategic goals of TFLs Strategic Plan are:

Strategic Goal 1  Increase programmatic impact and service provision
Strategic Goal 2  Communities have improved social determinants and healthy living 
Strategic Goal 3  Communities have increased economic and social opportunities Strategic Goal 4 Communities have increased resilience to respond to emergency situations</narrative>
  </description>
